+
+## Authentication and roles
+
+Every request carries `Authorization: Bearer <key>`, matched against `apiKeys`
+in the data file (`{ key, name, role }`). Missing or unknown keys return 401
+(`unauthorized`); valid keys without permission return 403 (`forbidden`).
+
+- `viewer`: read (`GET`) routes, except `GET /audit`.
+- `cook`: everything `viewer` can do, plus `POST /recipes/:id/cook`,
+  `POST /batches/:id/waste`, `POST /temperatures`, and
+  `POST /stocktakes/:id/counts`.
+- `manager`: everything, including `GET /audit` (audit entries of
+  data-changing requests, newest first).

